displayName, attributeSetType match
within the resource scope; duplicate
matches fail
end note
opt force-new or conflicting drift is detected
ServiceManager --> BaseReconciler: reject before OCI mutation
end
opt supported mutable drift is detected
ServiceManager -> OCI: Apply UpdateAttributeSet only for\nmutable fields attributeSetValues,\ncompartmentId, definedTags,\ndescription (+2 more)
loop update pending UPDATING
ServiceManager -> OCI: GetAttributeSet
end
end
ServiceManager -> OCI: run helper hooks\ncreate=tfresource.CreateResource\nentity=AttributeSet\naction=CreateAttributeSet;\nupdate=tfresource.UpdateResource\nentity=AttributeSet\naction=UpdateAttributeSet,\nChangeAttributeSetCompartment;\ndelete=tfresource.DeleteResource\nentity=AttributeSet\naction=DeleteAttributeSet
ServiceManager -> OCI: apply follow-up strategy\ncreate=read-after-write;\nupdate=read-after-write;\ndelete=confirm-delete
end
ServiceManager --> BaseReconciler: status=required,\nfinalizer=retain-until-confirmed-delete
end
BaseReconciler --> Controller: requeue on provisioning, updating,\nterminating
